{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/872665-basic-systems-changes-2nd-to-c20","id":872665,"title":"Basic systems changes 2nd to C20?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-04-23T15:11:05-07:00","id":872665,"title":"Basic systems changes 2nd to C20?","content":"<span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Well, C20 is on its way. We know some bits and pieces, but we'll mostly have to wait for the new big system revisions like Cantrips, build-your-own Kith, etc.<br /> <br /> But, what about those minor tweaks the big three lines got with their revised editions? What are the minor rules tweaks we know are incoming? Like Willpower taking 1 freebie instead of two, dodge being eaten by athletics, etc.<br /> <br /> So what are the rest?</span></span></span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11658-rabbit-pooka","name":"Rabbit Pooka","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11658_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"65"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-24T12:56:37-07:00","id":873238,"title":"","content":"We've already had a sneak peek at the cantrips system.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":5291,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","user":"adambeyoncelowe","date":". 04-24-2016, 04:13 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-24T13:14:13-07:00","id":873246,"title":"","content":"The basics yeah, but not the specifics of the individual Cantrips, how Realms are going to work. Which Arts and Realms are included. How the Dark Ages: Fae Dominions are going to work, are they just four more Arts or a separate system entirely? In one of the actual plays from the designers' playtests they explicitly mention Unleashing Summer, which sounds an awful lot like Day from DAF. That's what I mean by &quot;big systems&quot; that we don't know much about. We can assume, sure. But we don't know. <br /> <br /> The &quot;basic system&quot; stuff I'm curious about is the minor mechanical stuff like initiative, splitting dice pools, etc. This is stuff we can assume and have a high chance of already knowing because it's already been handled in the other X20 games. Freebie cost of willpower, merits &amp; flaws being optional back of the book material, etc.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11658-rabbit-pooka","name":"Rabbit Pooka","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11658_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"65"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-24T15:35:44-07:00","id":873338,"title":"","content":"Look to V20 and W20 for core mechanics that aren't Changeling specific. The ability list might be tweaked a bit for C20, but there's a conscious effort to keep things somewhat uniform.<br /> <br /> As for the DA: Fae Dominions in C20, that's news to me! Summer got unleashed in one of my play test sessions, but so did Legerdemain and Dragon's Ire in subsequent ones.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Charlie Cantrell</b><br /> Onyx Path Freelancer <hr />Changeling: The Dreaming 20th Anniversary Edition, Conquering Heroes, Book of Freeholds, Guide to the Night, C20 Players Guide","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/648-pookaknight","name":"PookaKnight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar648_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"690"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-24T16:00:15-07:00","id":873358,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>PookaKnight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/872665-basic-systems-changes-2nd-to-c20?p=873338#post873338\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As for the DA: Fae Dominions in C20, that's news to me! Summer got unleashed in one of my play test sessions, but so did Legerdemain and Dragon's Ire in subsequent ones.</div> </div> </div> </div>Really? How odd. When the playtest report mentioned Summer being Unleashed, I assumed it was the DA: Fae Dominion Day, associated with the Summer court, and just called Summer. Huh. The effects sound an awful lot like the Dominion powers / areas of focus for Day so I just assumed the four Dominions were being made into Arts. Curiouser and curiouser...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11658-rabbit-pooka","name":"Rabbit Pooka","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11658_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"65"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-25T18:55:48-07:00","id":874166,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rabbit Pooka</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/872665-basic-systems-changes-2nd-to-c20?p=873358#post873358\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Really? How odd. When the playtest report mentioned Summer being Unleashed, I assumed it was the DA: Fae Dominion Day, associated with the Summer court, and just called Summer. Huh. The effects sound an awful lot like the Dominion powers / areas of focus for Day so I just assumed the four Dominions were being made into Arts. Curiouser and curiouser...</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, if you're able to Unleash Summer but Summer isn't a Dominion, that would suggest that Summer is a new Art. If so, by mentioning it alongside Legerdemain and Dragon's Ire, we might also infer that the Dragon's Ire is now an Art too?<br /> <br /> I've got mixed feelings about that. The old Arts were, frankly, mostly naff. Creating new Arts (Summer?) and refashioning other subsystems into new Arts (Dragon's Ire, Contracts?), certainly makes the Arts on offer more juicy. <br /> <br /> However, the Dragon's Ire was one of my favourite subsystems because it evened the playing field in combat without having to buy additional traits (except, perhaps, Remembrance). I suppose it overcomes the problem of Remembrance being too overpowered/essential. I just liked that, in theory, it was an innate power before. This way does make sense, though, if you're overhauling the Arts and simplifying the systems.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-26T06:20:41-07:00","id":874472,"title":"","content":"I can't argue with the logic, but keep in mind that the play test sessions are to see what works and what doesn't. Just because something is one way in a play test write-up doesn't necessarily mean it'll be that way when C20 is released.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Charlie Cantrell</b><br /> Onyx Path Freelancer <hr />Changeling: The Dreaming 20th Anniversary Edition, Conquering Heroes, Book of Freeholds, Guide to the Night, C20 Players Guide","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/648-pookaknight","name":"PookaKnight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar648_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"690"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-26T11:02:39-07:00","id":874697,"title":"","content":"True. True.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}